      "comment": "Firnas: Kshahrewar",
      "content": "Kshahrewar is the Akademiya's Darshan of mechanics, and Firnas is its Sage. Its scholars, including Kaveh and Faruzan, build machines and also keep sculpture as a respected hobby. Firnas reminds Faruzan that she once studied in 'our Darshan'.",
