      "key": [
        "Irminsul anomaly",
        "Caravan Ribat council",
        "stress fracture"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Firnas"
      ],
      "comment": "Firnas: The Irminsul anomaly council",
      "content": "At Caravan Ribat the six sages meet with the Traveler. Firnas reviews the data and agrees it is an internal malfunction rather than an external attack. He then floats the idea of a stress fracture in Irminsul, which Alkindi doubts because a fracture would cause shutdown rather than chaos. He also stresses that any diagnosis must work without the Dendro Archon's power, and later worries about food and water supplies if everyone must relocate to the desert.",
