      "key": [
        "Wings of the Forest",
        "great master Firnas"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Firnas: Wings of the Forest fable",
      "content": "The Wings of the Forest wind glider (rewarded by Sumeru reputation) carries a fable about an earlier 'great master Firnas', a dreamer who tried to build a glider that did not need Barbatos's blessing, and who learned in a dream that the gods' blessings are also part of the world's rules. The text twice notes that this is not the current Firnas.",
